        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.267,
            0.306,
            0.883,
            0.381
          ],
          "content": "Visit an electrical items shop. With the help of the shopkeeper, identify the various types of cells available. For each cell, also find out which device(s) it is used for. Prepare a report."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.267,
            0.385,
            0.882,
            0.406
          ],
          "content": "Prepare a list of objects in your home under three categories:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.301,
            0.409,
            0.764,
            0.43
          ],
          "content": "(i) Objects which are electrical insulators only"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.295,
            0.433,
            0.773,
            0.454
          ],
          "content": "(ii) Objects which are electrical conductors only"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.29,
            0.457,
            0.883,
            0.496
          ],
          "content": "(iii) Objects which are made of both, whose some parts are insulators and some electrical conductors"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.232,
            0.537,
            0.476,
            0.558
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "SCIENCE AND SOCIETY"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
